.TH USERS 1 "September 13, 2026"
.SH NAME
users \- list login-session names
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B users
.RI [ file ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B users
utility reads
.B utmp
records from
.B /var/run/utmp
or the named file, removes duplicate nonempty names, sorts the names, and
writes one space-separated line.
.PP
The utility stores at most
.B NPROC
distinct names.  A larger or partial input is rejected, so malformed files
cannot grow resident memory.
